  $vtg$east-atlanta-strut$vtg$, $vtg$atlanta$vtg$, $vtg$East Atlanta Strut$vtg$, $vtg$Street festival + parade$vtg$, array[$vtg$Street$vtg$, $vtg$Portraits$vtg$]::text[], $vtg$East Atlanta Village$vtg$, 33.7407, -84.3444, null, $vtg$Late September (Saturday)$vtg$, $vtg$2026-09-26$vtg$, $vtg$2026-09-26$vtg$, $vtg$high$vtg$, $vtg$free$vtg$, $vtg$free — volunteer-run, benefits the community$vtg$, $vtg$medium$vtg$, $vtg$golden$vtg$, $vtg$EAV's scruffy, joyful block party$vtg$, $vtg$Parade, Porchfest, and a street full of character$vtg$, $vtg$East Atlanta Village's signature day — a quirky neighborhood parade, a Porchfest of bands on porches, a 5K, and a market — in one of the most characterful, unpolished intown neighborhoods. The aesthetic is gloriously DIY and the people lean in.$vtg$, array[$vtg$The parade's homemade floats and characters down Flat Shoals$vtg$, $vtg$Porchfest — bands and crowds spilling off front porches$vtg$, $vtg$The Village's murals and old storefronts as backdrop to the crowd$vtg$]::text[], $vtg${"wide":"A porch band and its crowd, the whole scene and the house behind it","normal":"Loose, characterful street candids — EAV is made for a 35mm","tele":"Isolate a parade character or a musician mid-song","macro":"The DIY detail — hand-painted signs, float scraps, instruments"}$vtg$::jsonb, $vtg$Flat Shoals & Glenwood, East Atlanta Village; rideshare is easiest (limited transit).$vtg$, $vtg$eastatlantastrut.com$vtg$, true)
