  $vtg$shaky-knees$vtg$, $vtg$atlanta$vtg$, $vtg$Shaky Knees Music Festival$vtg$, $vtg$Music festival (ticketed)$vtg$, array[$vtg$Street$vtg$, $vtg$Portraits$vtg$]::text[], $vtg$Piedmont Park, Midtown$vtg$, 33.7859, -84.3733, $vtg$piedmont$vtg$, $vtg$Mid-September (relocated to Piedmont Park in 2026; formerly late Apr/early May at Central Park)$vtg$, $vtg$2026-09-18$vtg$, $vtg$2026-09-20$vtg$, $vtg$high$vtg$, $vtg$ticketed$vtg$, $vtg$Ticketmaster / festival site$vtg$, $vtg$high$vtg$, $vtg$golden$vtg$, $vtg$Guitars on the meadow, Midtown behind the stage$vtg$, $vtg$Big indie/rock festival, Midtown skyline as backdrop$vtg$, $vtg$Atlanta's big indie-and-rock festival takes over Piedmont Park for a September weekend — a louder, younger crowd than the park's other festivals, with the Midtown towers stacking up behind the field as the light goes gold. Ticketed, but a strong shoot for raw crowd energy and that skyline-behind-the-band frame.$vtg$, array[$vtg$The stage crowd with the Midtown skyline behind, hands up at golden hour$vtg$, $vtg$Crowd-surf and lost-in-it moments during a set$vtg$, $vtg$Festival fashion and faces out on the meadow between acts$vtg$]::text[], $vtg${"wide":"Stage, crowd, and Midtown towers stacked in one frame","normal":"In-crowd candids and the between-sets drift","tele":"Single faces and silhouettes against the stage light","macro":"Wristbands, setlists, festival detail"}$vtg$::jsonb, $vtg$Piedmont Park, Midtown; Midtown MARTA + a walk, or rideshare. Ticketed — plan entry.$vtg$, $vtg$shakykneesfestival.com$vtg$, true)
